  "description_blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Halloween in Motion"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "More than a cute seasonal display, this spooky ghost drives around under remote control for unforgettable RC fun."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Scare After Dark"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Lighting effects add atmosphere before the ghost even starts moving. Pair motion with eerie illumination to make dark rooms, entryways, and displays feel instantly more theatrical."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Easy to Build, Easy to Enjoy"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Simple assembly and a practical, accessible design make installation and maintenance hassle-free."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Remote Control Instruction"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "This model is designed to work with the CyberBrick Remote. The pre-configured settings have been uploaded for immediate play,"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "while the CyberBrick App allows full customization of controller functions to match your personal preferences."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "* Please visit the CyberBrick Official Standard Remote on Makerworld for more details."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "CyberBrick App Connection Tutorial"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "*The following is the App connection of CyberBrick Official SoccerBot as an example, which is similar to this model."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Core Safety Rules"
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "This product is intended for users aged 14 and above. Users under the age of 14 must be under direct adult supervision throughout use."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "DO NOT touch the moving parts while the device is operating to prevent pinching injuries."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Please use only official tools for any firmware operations. Flashing with third-party tools is not supported and may cause irreversible damage, which is not covered by warranty."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Before use, inspect all 3D-printed parts and sand down any sharp edges or burrs if present. Store the model and small parts in a location out of reach of children and pets to prevent choking hazards."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Warning of Lithium Battery"
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "This product utilizes a replaceable rechargeable lithium battery."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Adult supervision is required when children are handling batteries or the charger. Do not operate the product while it is charging."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Ensure the battery is installed correctly. Improper installation may result in short circuits, overheating, or potential explosion."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Regularly inspect the charger’s cord, plug, housing, and other components for damage. If any damage is found, discontinue use immediately until the device is fully repaired."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Choking Hazard: Contains small parts; not suitable for children under 3 years of age."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Improper disposal of this product may harm the environment - please recycle responsibly."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Charging Precautions"
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Use only the officially supplied charger. The charger is not a toy."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "The USB charger for this product only supports standard 5V 1-2A input. Please always use the original charger that meets the voltage/current requirements, or charge directly via a computer USB port. DO NOT use chargers with output higher than 5V or 2A (such as mobile fast chargers, 9V/12V adapters, etc.), as this may cause device damage, overheating, or even serious fire hazards."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "DO NOT cover the device while charging, and keep it away from high temperature, humidity, or flammable environments. Never charge the device unattended."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "DO NOT charge the battery pack if it is overheating. Allow it to cool down completely before recharging."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "If the battery pack or charger becomes wet, ensure they are thoroughly dry before attempting to charge."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Lithium Battery Safety Precautions"
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "DO NOT attempt to use or charge the battery pack if it shows any signs of leakage or corrosion."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "DO NOT disassemble, crush, or mechanically abuse the battery pack."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "DO NOT dispose of the battery pack in fire."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Exercise extreme caution when handling an overheated battery pack."
    }
  ],
  "description_html": "<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-stpcic\">\n<div class=\"pct_stpc-ic\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\">\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\">Halloween in Motion</h3>\n<div data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\" data-page-id=\"module-content\">\n<p class=\"pct_p\" style=\"text-align: left;\">More than a cute seasonal display, this spooky ghost drives around under remote control for unforgettable RC fun.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- 右侧图片部分 -->\n<div class=\"pct_ic\"><video autoplay=\"autoplay\" class=\"product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--video bg-bbl-white animate-pulse aspect-video max-h-[400px]\" controls=\"controls\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-mce-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s1/default/d9fc512c53dc4418b165e850c36bc5c8/Bring_Halloween_to_Life.mp4\" data-mce-style=\"width: 100%;\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s1/default/d9fc512c53dc4418b165e850c36bc5c8/Bring_Halloween_to_Life.mp4\" height=\"150\" loop=\"loop\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s1/default/d9fc512c53dc4418b165e850c36bc5c8/Bring_Halloween_to_Life.mp4\" style=\"width: 100%;\" width=\"300\"></video></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct_stpc-ic\"><!-- 第2卖点 -->\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\">\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Scare After Dark</h3>\n<p class=\"pct_p\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Lighting effects add atmosphere before the ghost even starts moving. Pair motion with eerie illumination to make dark rooms, entryways, and displays feel instantly more theatrical.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct_ic\"><video autoplay=\"autoplay\" class=\"product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--video bg-bbl-white animate-pulse aspect-video max-h-[400px]\" controls=\"controls\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-mce-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s1/default/a0115f6a8000472888b7138653066e1c/Frightening_lighting_effects.mp4\" data-mce-style=\"width: 100%;\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s1/default/a0115f6a8000472888b7138653066e1c/Frightening_lighting_effects.mp4\" height=\"150\" loop=\"loop\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s1/default/a0115f6a8000472888b7138653066e1c/Frightening_lighting_effects.mp4\" style=\"width: 100%;\" width=\"300\"></video></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-stpcic\">\n<div class=\"pct_stpc-ic\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\">\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\">Easy to Build, Easy to Enjoy</h3>\n<div data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\" data-page-id=\"module-content\">\n<p class=\"pct_p\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Simple assembly and a practical, accessible design make installation and maintenance hassle-free.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- 右侧图片部分 -->\n<div class=\"pct_ic\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"pct_mi product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s1/default/9dd77f7eb8b8425e9c84b0b88d9138ba/PXL_20260916_072404844_2.png\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/><img alt=\"\" class=\"pct_i product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s1/default/9dd77f7eb8b8425e9c84b0b88d9138ba/PXL_20260916_072404844_2.png\" height=\"500\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\" width=\"750\"/></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_ic\">\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_tpc-ic\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-p\">\n<p></p>\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\" style=\"margin-top: 20px; font-size: 24px;\">Remote Control Instruction</h2>\n<p class=\"pct_p\" style=\"text-align: center;\">This model is designed to work with the CyberBrick Remote. The pre-configured settings have been uploaded for immediate play,</p>\n<p>while the CyberBrick App allows full customization of controller functions to match your personal preferences.</p>\n<p class=\"pct_p\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><em><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">* Please visit the <a href=\"https://makerworld.com/en/models/1395991-cyberbrick-official-standard-remote#profileId-1446992\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong><span style=\"color: #00ae42;\">CyberBrick Official Standard Remote on Makerworld </span></strong></a> for more details.</span></em></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<style>\n        .image-container {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 30px; \n            justify-content: center; \n            align-items: center; \n            height: auto; \n        }\n        .image-container img {\n            width: 650px;\n            height: flex;\n            object-fit: contain; \n        }\n    </style>\n<div class=\"image-container\"><img class=\"product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse aspect-video max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s1/default/749f0ef7f70f4a7ca851b66b7dfd73b6/steering_ghost_1.png\" height=\"525\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\" width=\"735\"/> <a href=\"https://bambulab.com/en/download/cyberbrick-apps\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><img class=\"product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse aspect-video max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s1/default/c822010a332c4bf6b9c6ec5db116a293/Frame_1123867487.jpg\" height=\"527\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iM